  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "把几种光影现象放在一块底板上",
        "en": "Several light effects on one baseboard"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/D2008/64043e2a4a5c.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "套装组合雾化器、七彩旋转投影灯、导光柱、导光房和指示灯。可以分别观察每个组件，再按说明连接，查看雾化、投影与导光的不同表现。",
        "en": "The kit combines an atomizer, multicolor rotating projection light, light-guide column, light-guide house and indicator light. Examine the parts separately, then follow the instructions to observe their different effects."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "38件配件，7岁及以上",
        "en": "38 accessories, ages 7+"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/D2008/92255d83da4f.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "包装标注38件配件和7岁及以上。组件铺设在可见底板上，适合边搭建边辨认连接位置；开始前先把配件按功能分开，避免混放。",
        "en": "The package is marked with 38 accessories and ages 7+. Components sit on a visible baseboard so the connection positions can be seen during assembly. Sort the pieces by function before starting."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "供电与装盒规格",
        "en": "Power and packing"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/D2008/d2213619e7cb.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "需要三节AA电池，电池不包含在套装内。单品彩盒尺寸35 × 26 × 6.8 cm，使用后可先拆分小组件，再按种类收好，便于下一次搭建。",
        "en": "Three AA batteries are required and are not included. The color box measures 35 × 26 × 6.8 cm. After use, separate and store the smaller components by type for the next assembly."
      }
    }
  ],
